<Layout title="Cancellation & Refund Policy — Rakhi Battle by BondBop" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 26 August 2026.</p>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a BondBop game operated in India by Divya Pandey. Support: <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Digital products and cancellation</h2>
    <p>Paid upgrades are digital products delivered immediately after verified payment. Because fulfilment starts at once, an order cannot ordinarily be cancelled after the purchased content has been successfully unlocked and delivered.</p>
    <h2>Duplicate charge or failed delivery</h2>
    <p>If you are charged more than once for the same battle, or a verified payment does not unlock the purchased content, submit a <a href="/contact">support request</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a> within 7 days. Include the battle code and payment reference. After verification, an eligible refund will be sent to the original payment method; bank or payment-provider processing time may apply.</p>
    <h2>Safety</h2>
    <p>Never send a UPI PIN, OTP, full card number or online-banking password. We do not need these to investigate a payment.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
